# Files that execute or get parsed on Linux must stay LF even on a Windows
# checkout: busybox sh hard-fails on `then\r`, and a Windows-built Docker
# image COPYs whatever line endings the working tree has. Discovered by
# running the nginx entrypoint under busybox from a Windows checkout.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.template text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
